sc":"重生归来，王志猩摇身一变七心传媒气场十足的猩姐，担任金牌经纪人。旗下何安娜、陈俊如等一众艺人状况百出，负面黑料接连爆出。绯闻八卦、争议话题、舆论危机轮番上演，一堆棘手难题全都压到猩姐身上。她一边不停收拾各位艺人闯下的烂摊子，一边统筹规划所有人的事业发展路线。猩姐开启高强度控场模式，澄清不实流言、化解一次次公关危机，管教一众问题艺人，带领大家在纷繁复杂的娱乐圈里逆风成长。","series_id":"7670802927400799256","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349617154\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623560831A0922B062038A5DBAE\",\"rank\":\"8\",\"gid\":\"7670802927400799256\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\"}","recommend_group_id":"7670802927400799256","play_cnt":3822996,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"稳前文化","sub_title":"都市·都市日常","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":22,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5022,\"name\":\"都市\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5022&categoryName=都市&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5078,\"name\":\"都市日常\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5078&categoryName=都市日常&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5178,\"name\":\"逆风翻盘\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5178&categoryName=逆风翻盘&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5119,\"name\":\"轻松搞笑\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5119&categoryName=轻松搞笑&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5128,\"name\":\"重生\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5128&categoryName=重生&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5221,\"name\":\"女强\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5221&categoryName=女强&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5250,\"name\":\"直爽女主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5250&categoryName=直爽女主&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5338&categoryName=现代&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5320,\"name\":\"娱乐圈\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://cat